{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"rlc-circuit-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["rlc-circuit-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"En la resonancia, un RLC en serie ideal tiene una impedancia mínima igual a R; un RLC en paralelo ideal tiene una impedancia máxima igual a R. El comportamiento de la corriente y el voltaje, por lo tanto, difieren aunque f₀ ideal sea el mismo.","record_id":"8cf261303a2c6ea45d5dd6aabaf3e9c33e784c3649f1bd0968eee0411d4e0d5e","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.0133960053750002,"source":"At resonance, an ideal series RLC has minimum impedance equal to R; an ideal parallel RLC has maximum impedance equal to R. Current and voltage behavior therefore differ even though ideal f₀ is the same.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"a0027fb9c91e4376b4b288a1bf0485cb799a4f5fc2a2d349880e24e09cd01b09","status":"machine-draft","translation":"En la resonancia, un RLC en serie ideal tiene una impedancia mínima igual a R; un RLC en paralelo ideal tiene una impedancia máxima igual a R. El comportamiento de la corriente y el voltaje, por lo tanto, difieren aunque f₀ ideal sea el mismo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
